# =============================================================================
# IP PROTECTION — DO NOT REMOVE OR LOOSEN THESE RULES WITHOUT REVIEW
# =============================================================================
# This repository must never contain disc data, extracted assets, or any
# material owned by Sony Interactive Entertainment / Team Ico.
# The rules below ignore every common PS2 dump and extracted-asset format.
# If you need to add a real source file whose name happens to collide, prefer
# renaming the file rather than weakening the patterns.
# =============================================================================

# --- Disc images and PS2 executables ---
*.bin
*.iso
*.cue
*.chd
*.mdf
*.mds
*.nrg
*.elf
*.irx
SLUS-*
SLES-*
SLPS-*
SLPM-*
SCUS-*
SCES-*
SCPS-*
baserom/
baseelf*

# --- Build outputs that may embed disc-derived data ---
build/
*.o
*.a
*.lib
*.obj
*.map
*.ld.tmp

# --- Extracted assets (populated at build time from the user's disc) ---
assets/**
!assets/.gitkeep
!assets/README.md

# --- Disassembled / split asm (regenerated by splat from the user's ELF) ---
# Everything under asm/ is regenerated from the user's ELF. Splat 0.40.0 emits
# per-function baselines under asm/matchings/<name>/<func>.s when a subsegment
# is flipped to `c` — those baselines are reproducible from the ELF, so they
# stay gitignored too. Hand-written non-matching stubs (legacy snap convention)
# under asm/nonmatchings/ are tracked.
asm/**
!asm/.gitkeep
!asm/README.md
!asm/nonmatchings/
!asm/nonmatchings/**
asm/nonmatchings/**/*.s.bak

# --- Audio / texture / model dumps ---
*.aifc
*.aiff
*.wav
*.adp
*.vag
*.vab
*.mid
*.seq
*.tm2
*.png.bin
*.rgba16
*.rgba32

# --- Symbol files derived from the original ELF ---
# (Symbol *names* invented by us are fine; raw vendor symbol tables are not.)
*.sym.bak

# --- Toolchain / venv / editor noise ---
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.idea/
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Local config overrides ---
.env
.env.local
config/local.*
expected/

# --- m2c context output (regenerated on demand) ---
ctx.c

# --- Local toolchain blobs (Ghidra, ee-gcc, ps2toolchain source build) ---
tools/toolchain/
tools/ghidra/
tools/cc/

# --- Auto-generated linker script (regenerated by splat on every split) ---
config/ico.us.ld
config/ico.us.d
config/undefined_syms_auto.us.txt
config/undefined_funcs_auto.us.txt

# --- Agent guidance / local-only ---
# CLAUDE.md is auto-loaded by Claude Code and is the agent's local preamble;
# kept out of the public repo to match the snap project's convention.
# decomp/MATCH.md is the public, user-facing matching prompt.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
decomp/RUN_LOG.md
.cache/
